+		what they think/value it seems i think maybe), was 100.-->
+		<!-- custom: but it does seem like they never ever declare war when requesting tribute making it pointless, trying to increase it more; it's maybe also more realistic this way, as the losing side will just have to comply regardless how insensitive/senseless the request is, was 110. -->
+		<DefineName>UWAI_WEIGHT_REBUKE</DefineName>
+		<iDefineIntVal>200</iDefineIntVal>
