+		<!-- custom: now seemingly tremendously improved multi war threat management thanks to the new "emergency peace code" we added instead (but that these uwai defines helped me locate) in UWAI::Team::considerPeace in UWAIAgent.cpp, see known issue as of now 65 for details -->
+		<DefineName>UWAI_WEIGHT_DISTRACTION</DefineName>
