+		 font size of Size2_Normal in Civ4Theme_Common.thm. AdvCiv sets that
+		 to 16. If a mod-mod changes Size2_Normal, then FONT_SIZE_FACTOR should
+		 be adjusted accordingly. If the AdvCiv theme is removed (and not
+		 replaced with a different custom theme), then there should be no need
+		 to edit this value; the DLL can figure that out on its own. -->
+	<Define>
+		<DefineName>HELP_FONT_SIZE</DefineName>
+		<iDefineIntVal>16</iDefineIntVal>
+	</Define>
+
+	<!-- advc.009: Moved from GlobalDefinesAlt.xml.
+		 302 in BtS, 303 in K-Mod. Picking 14223 as a unique id
+		 (that's A-D-V-C in numbers). Note that this number is only relevant
+		 for savegame version changes within the life cycle of a mod (none so
+		 far for AdvCiv). Setting this to e.g. 303 will not allow K-Mod saves
+		 to be loaded as the mod name is stored in the savegame and the EXE
+		 will reject the savegame if that name doesn't match the (folder) name
+		 of the currently loaded mod.
+		 Mod-mods should use a different SAVE_VERSION, ideally a completely
+		 different one, though this currently only matters for the
+		 HOF_DISPLAY_OTHER_MOD_REPLAYS option (see below). -->
+	<!-- custom: todo? leaving as is for now -->
+	<Define> <!-- redefine -->
+		<DefineName>SAVE_VERSION</DefineName>
+		<iDefineIntVal>14223</iDefineIntVal>
+	</Define>
